{"1746930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SunnySide", "steam_appid": 1746930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/61f6f3e2d0de8800be079d0ecb4f7d2d.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>You’ve just purchased your first plot of land in an aging post town in the heart of the Japanese countryside. Now, it’s up to you to create a homestead you can be proud of.<br>•\tMaster the art of farming.<br>•\tExplore local resources.<br>•\tBuild your dream home.<br>•\tCare for your animals.<br>•\tBond with the locals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/9d9c2b2ec3308391517f79ecaf55b49f.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/9d9c2b2ec3308391517f79ecaf55b49f.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/9d9c2b2ec3308391517f79ecaf55b49f.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use modern technology to balance time between your new farm life and joining the local community.<br>•\tMeet new people and learn about their lives.<br>•\tSupport their businesses.<br>•\tHang out around town and in the city.<br>•\tPursue some romance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/701b107ee7298f00b16a82bc468691f1.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/701b107ee7298f00b16a82bc468691f1.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/701b107ee7298f00b16a82bc468691f1.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/e2f134c569baca1e68b9d80e896f1b11.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>With a focus on individuality, SunnySide is full of creative freedom and self-expression.<br>•\tCreate your main character.<br>•\tBuild anything, anywhere, on your own plot of land.<br>•\tCustomize your phone and drone<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/6e586e7d3d2d45e25eb3fd816f7d7390.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/6e586e7d3d2d45e25eb3fd816f7d7390.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/6e586e7d3d2d45e25eb3fd816f7d7390.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Move at your own pace and follow your own path. The best way to play is whatever way makes you the most happy!<br>•\t113 crops to grow.<br>•\t27 Characters to befriend.<br>•\tHundreds of cooking and foodcraft recipes.<br>•\tA realistic economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/e980f50dfc5e77181e2fb71fb0571400.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/e980f50dfc5e77181e2fb71fb0571400.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/e980f50dfc5e77181e2fb71fb0571400.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/59c6bcd4e7e46d91213a32a0dc0de7b9.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>Modernize your farming experience with new technology that brings the classic, farming sim genre to the 21st century. Worry less about tedious daily tasks and enjoy living a life of balance.<br>•\tHose watering!<br>•\tContainer and Raised Bed Gardening.<br>•\tSustainable energy generation<br>•\tDrip tape watering systems.<br>•\tBulk animal care.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/304f88e4c4250d9386a781bb3194ed7e.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/304f88e4c4250d9386a781bb3194ed7e.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/304f88e4c4250d9386a781bb3194ed7e.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A proper homestead is self sufficient, and your home in SunnySide is no different. Elevate your crops and animal goods into artisanal food craft and sell to local stores to help support the economy.<br>•\tMaster food craft machines including dehydrators, milk separators, cheese kettles, fermentation barrels, canners, and more.<br>•\tDry your own seeds, tea, and animal feed.<br>•\tCook up your own artisan tofu.<br>•\tFerment beer and soy sauce.<br>•\tPress your own oils.<br>•\tBottle, jar, and package your goods to sell for a higher price.<br>•\tSell to local businesses, to shops in the city, or at the Farmer’s Market on weekends. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/1bed194e74b343c8449a77fce96d2abe.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/1bed194e74b343c8449a77fce96d2abe.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/1bed194e74b343c8449a77fce96d2abe.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/ab3d2ffe378b26ea646ff9077eeffeae.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>After a thousand year old sassy survey drone named Sparky rescues you from a cave in, you’re tasked with helping this new companion retrieve their lost memories and complete the last mission they remember: learn more about humans.<br>•\tHelp Sparky determine the nature of humans.<br>•\tJoin Sparky on a mission towards self discovery.<br>•\tExplore the mysterious caves together and team-up in a cozy card-based battle system<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/3fef46c2e6e7ad1ad14d4079821f3631.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>The best part of living in the country is becoming part of a community.<br>•\tEnjoy unique hang outs with the residents of SunnySide.<br>•\tListen to their stories and witness their lives.<br>•\tForm bonds, attend events, build a life, and maybe even find someone special to share your days with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>While a quiet life in the countryside is nice, SunnySide isn’t perfect. The locals have distinct personalities, histories, motivations, and needs… but their stories are interwoven with each other’s lives. It’s up to you to determine how involved you want to be.<br>•\tExperience stories from multiple perspectives.<br>•\tSee how people’s lives impact each other.<br>•\tExplore complicated themes like family trauma, failed relationships, guilt, blame, aging, and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/4f8e20ae2bca0e3ea733ed8d7113998c.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>•\tExperience innovative gameplay that finally modernizes the classic Farm Sim.<br>•\tJoin the established community of SunnySide and build relationships with its many inhabitants.<br>•\tExpress yourself with deep customisation in character creation and building your homestead.<br>•\tUse your time to chase your interests and truly express yourself.<br>•\tEnjoy a unique and cozy battle system as you explore the caves beneath SunnySide.<br><br><strong>Disclaimer: SunnySide is a Farm Sim with no watering cans, shipping containers, gift-based socializing, mayonnaise machines, marriage, children, or a hotbar crowded with tools.</strong>", "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/61f6f3e2d0de8800be079d0ecb4f7d2d.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>You’ve just purchased your first plot of land in an aging post town in the heart of the Japanese countryside. Now, it’s up to you to create a homestead you can be proud of.<br>•\tMaster the art of farming.<br>•\tExplore local resources.<br>•\tBuild your dream home.<br>•\tCare for your animals.<br>•\tBond with the locals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/9d9c2b2ec3308391517f79ecaf55b49f.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor