 retrieve their lost memories and complete the last mission they remember: learn more about humans.<br>•\tHelp Sparky determine the nature of humans.<br>•\tJoin Sparky on a mission towards self discovery.<br>•\tExplore the mysterious caves together and team-up in a cozy card-based battle system<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/a6ccffcf6c18fec1b11f4601dded7f0b.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/3fef46c2e6e7ad1ad14d4079821f3631.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>The best part of living in the country is becoming part of a community.<br>•\tEnjoy unique hang outs with the residents of SunnySide.<br>•\tListen to their stories and witness their lives.<br>•\tForm bonds, attend events, build a life, and maybe even find someone special to share your days with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/5366c5d152382c2afb858b083d0594ff.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>While a quiet life in the countryside is nice, SunnySide isn’t perfect. The locals have distinct personalities, histories, motivations, and needs… but their stories are interwoven with each other’s lives. It’s up to you to determine how involved you want to be.<br>•\tExperience stories from multiple perspectives.<br>•\tSee how people’s lives impact each other.<br>•\tExplore complicated themes like family trauma, failed relationships, guilt, blame, aging, and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.poster.avif?t=1769733809\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.webm?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/7f1230dd926012b56668e705f3ec8238.mp4?t=1769733809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/extras/4f8e20ae2bca0e3ea733ed8d7113998c.avif?t=1769733809\" width=614 height=66 /></span><br><br>•\tExperience innovative gameplay that finally modernizes the classic Farm Sim.<br>•\tJoin the established community of SunnySide and build relationships with its many inhabitants.<br>•\tExpress yourself with deep customisation in character creation and building your homestead.<br>•\tUse your time to chase your interests and truly express yourself.<br>•\tEnjoy a unique and cozy battle system as you explore the caves beneath SunnySide.<br><br><strong>Disclaimer: SunnySide is a Farm Sim with no watering cans, shipping containers, gift-based socializing, mayonnaise machines, marriage, children, or a hotbar crowded with tools.</strong>", "short_description": "Find harmony in the Japanese countryside as you help Sparky uncover lost memories in this modern take on the farming and life simulator. Build a thriving homestead, cultivate new relationships, and chase your own happiness in SunnySide.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/header.jpg?t=1769733809", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769733809", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769733809", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce® Gtx 1660 Super / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce® RTX 2060 / ATI Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong